  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the current master branch, after build and run the Fedora server using the following command:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> mvn clean install -pl fcrepo-webapp -Pone-click; java -jar fcrepo-webapp/target/fcrepo-webapp-5.0.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console.jar --headless",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A resource with ACL cannot be created either using POST or PUT. ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1. First create an acl",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> curl -v -XPUT  \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/acl1"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/acl1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2. create rdf resource with acl on POST",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "> curl -v -XPOST  -H \"Link: <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/acl1"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/acl1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">; rel=\\\"acl\\\"\" \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" -H \"Slug: test3\" -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The server response 409 Conflict with an error message \"The external path of the link header's ACL URI was not found\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This error message is added from ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1302"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1302",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
